* HyperActiveJ/sundance780-jacuzzi-balboa-rs485-tcp  (Sundance 780 / encrypted status)
* dhmsjs/pyjacuzzi                                   (Jacuzzi / Prolink)
* garbled1/pybalboa                                  (Balboa framing and CRC; Apache-2.0)
* ccutrer/balboa_worldwide_app                       (Balboa protocol documentation)
* jackbrown1993/Jacuzzi-RS485                         (Jacuzzi RS485)
* Iraithium/sundance-rs485-controller                (ESPHome prior art)

Test fixtures under tests/fixtures/captures/ are recordings of bus traffic from the
maintainer's tub and from community contributors.

